| Pipelined: the clips as Test does, but each picture given to the block
| without waiting (-p: checked while the block decodes the next); then
| the 1080p clip timed pipelined, and with four pictures given ahead
| (-P 4), to compare with Speed. Reports to ResultP.
| (a GCCSDK program: needs SharedUnixLibrary and ARMEABISupport loaded)
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 IfThere System:Modules.SharedULib Then RMLoad System:Modules.SharedULib
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 Error This needs SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 or later. Install it with PackMan.
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0 IfThere System:Modules.ARMEABISupport Then RMLoad System:Modules.ARMEABISupport
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0 Error This needs the ARMEABISupport module. Install it with PackMan.
WimpSlot -min 32768K -max 32768K
Remove <Obey$Dir>.ResultP
Run <Obey$Dir>.hevctest -p -o <Obey$Dir>.ResultP <Obey$Dir>.clips.small.trace
Run <Obey$Dir>.hevctest -p -o <Obey$Dir>.ResultP <Obey$Dir>.clips.slices.trace
Run <Obey$Dir>.hevctest -p -o <Obey$Dir>.ResultP <Obey$Dir>.clips.nowpp.trace
Run <Obey$Dir>.hevctest -p -o <Obey$Dir>.ResultP <Obey$Dir>.clips.odd.trace
Run <Obey$Dir>.hevctest -p -o <Obey$Dir>.ResultP <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.trace
Run <Obey$Dir>.hevctest -p -t -o <Obey$Dir>.ResultP <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.trace
Run <Obey$Dir>.hevctest -P 4 -t -o <Obey$Dir>.ResultP <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.trace
Run <Obey$Dir>.hevctest -p -o <Obey$Dir>.ResultP <Obey$Dir>.clips.small10.trace
Run <Obey$Dir>.hevctest -p -o <Obey$Dir>.ResultP <Obey$Dir>.clips.crop10.trace
Run <Obey$Dir>.hevctest -p -o <Obey$Dir>.ResultP <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd10.trace
Run <Obey$Dir>.hevctest -p -t -o <Obey$Dir>.ResultP <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd10.trace
